{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmyPAwSo4iVHBCbw3P5J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not choosing anything today. If I had to, I'd go with הראל, because it's a big name I know and its fees were the lowest I saw. But I didn't find a track on this page that I'm sure is as safe as my deposits, so I'll ask you or the bank before I sign anything. I'm not sure about any of it.\n\n**What decided it:** The safest-sounding name I saw was \"אג\"ח ממשלתי\" (\"government bonds\"), on one of the filter buttons at the top. I never found its row in the screens I read. The bond rows I did find, like \"אג\"ח סחיר\", only said \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" (\"less than 3 years\") in the returns column, so they have no record to look at. The rows with big numbers (24.04%, 26.39%) are shares, and I've already lost money on shares once. What also bothered me is that every company charges a fee of about 0.55% to 0.73% a year. At the bank I don't pay for advice.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top of the page. The title says \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" (\"all the tracks at all the companies\"), and the \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already lit up.\n2. The rows of buttons for what the money goes into. There were English letters, \"S&P 500\", and words like \"עוקב מדדים\" (I think \"tracks indexes\") that mean nothing to me.\n3. The line saying fees go \"מ־0.5% עד 0.73%\" (\"from 0.5% to 0.73%\").\n4. The הראל group of rows, then מור, אנליסט and מיטב. Each row has a fee, a little circle, returns for \"3 שנים\" and \"5 שנים\" (3 and 5 years), and an amount of money.\n\nI stopped after the sixth screen, about halfway down the מיטב rows. I didn't reach screens 7 to 15, so I don't know which companies come after מיטב.\n\n**What I skipped:** The links \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" (\"what is an investment savings fund\"), \"מדריך\" (\"guide\") and \"השקעה במדד\". I also skipped the circle pictures, the question-mark icons and the small arrows on the right.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:**\n- \"עוקב מדד\", \"S&P 500\", \"סחיר\", \"גמיש\", \"כספי (שקלי)\" and \"הלכה יהודית\".\n- \"מט\"ח\". Next to it there's sometimes 99% and sometimes 0%, and I don't know what it means.\n- \"חשיפה\" (\"exposure\").\n- \"דמי ניהול מההפקדה\" next to \"מההחיסכון\" (fees \"from the deposit\" next to fees \"from the savings\").\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" (\"not reported yet\") with an orange mark, and a little \"חדש\" (\"new\") label.\n- Under מיטב, one row says \"101%\" shares. How can it be more than a hundred?\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The black background with grey text was hard on my eyes even with my glasses. The headings at the top of each column are small and pale.\n- Every single row repeats \"מניות\" and \"מט\"ח\" (shares, foreign currency), \"מההחיסכון\" and \"מההפקדה\", and \"3 שנים\" and \"5 שנים\". I had to read them again on each row just to find what was different.\n- The circles use two colours, turquoise and yellow, and I had to look back and forth to match them to the numbers next to them.\n- So many rows say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" (\"less than 3 years\") instead of a number.\n- There's no sentence anywhere telling me which track is the safe one.\n- I don't know the site, \"מקור\" (\"Makor\"). I don't know who's behind it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3695,"cache_read_input_tokens":11712,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3695},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"735deef3-fbb3-4066-a113-b8e9541c6cd7","uuid":"d6bda6c3-4356-4923-b988-48429f8d475e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:15:42.517Z","request_id":"req_011CgmyPAhJjvZWnhG7W56kL"}
